#: src/introduction.md:3
msgid ""
"**goat is the operator's command-line for the data fabric** — one tool to "
"find the fabric, prove you can reach it, publish and subscribe to data, and "
"see what's happening underneath. It runs on macOS, Linux, and Windows, and "
"it works the same on a connected laptop or an air-gapped island."
msgstr ""
"**goat ass d'Kommandozeil vum Operateur fir d'Data Fabric** — een Tool fir "
"d'Fabric ze fannen, ze beweisen datt s du se erreeche kanns, Daten ze "
"publizéieren a ze abonnéieren, an ze gesinn wat drënner geschitt. Et leeft "
"op macOS, Linux a Windows, an et funktionéiert d'selwecht op engem "
"verbonnenen Laptop oder op enger air-gapped Insel."

#: src/introduction.md:5
msgid "If you have five minutes, here's the whole thing:"
msgstr "Wann s du fënnef Minutten hues, hei ass dat Ganzt:"

#: src/introduction.md:7
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"# 1. install it (one line — see \"Install & verify\" for the details)\n"
"curl -fsSL https://get.<your-goatnet>/goat-$(uname -s | tr A-Z a-z)-amd64 -o "
"~/.local/bin/goat && chmod +x ~/.local/bin/goat\n"
"\n"
"# 2. say hello — no profile, no mesh, no setup required\n"
"goat hello\n"
"\n"
"# 3. learn it hands-on, at your own pace\n"
"goat tutor\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"# 1. installéier et (eng Zeil — kuck \"Install & verify\" fir d'Detailer)\n"
"curl -fsSL https://get.<your-goatnet>/goat-$(uname -s | tr A-Z a-z)-amd64 -o "
"~/.local/bin/goat && chmod +x ~/.local/bin/goat\n"
"\n"
"# 2. sot hello — keen Profil, kee Mesh, keng Astellung néideg\n"
"goat hello\n"
"\n"
"# 3. léier et praktesch, an dengem eegene Tempo\n"
"goat tutor\n"
"```"

#: src/introduction.md:18
msgid ""
"That `goat hello` runs against an **in-process sandbox** — a fully simulated "
"fabric — so you can try the tool, learn the commands, and run the whole "
"tutorial before you've been handed any credentials, on a plane if you like. "
"When you're ready for the real thing, one bundle and `goat init` switches "
"you over."
msgstr ""
"Deen `goat hello` leeft géint eng **in-process Sandbox** — eng komplett "
"simuléiert Fabric — sou datt s du d'Tool probéiere, d'Befehler léieren an "
"dat ganzt Tutorial lafe loosse kanns, ier s du iergendwellech Umeldungsdaten "
"kritt hues, am Fliger wann s du wëlls. Wann s du fir dat richtegt prett "
"bass, ee Bündel an `goat init` wiesselt dech eriwwer."

#: src/introduction.md:20
msgid ""
"**The sandbox is always marked.** Anything simulated prints a `◇ SANDBOX` "
"banner. You will never mistake a practice run for the real fabric."
msgstr ""
"**D'Sandbox ass ëmmer markéiert.** Alles wat simuléiert ass weist e `◇ "
"SANDBOX` Banner. Du wäerts ni en Übungslaf mat der richteger Fabric "
"verwiesselen."

