#: src/languages.md:3
msgid ""
"goat speaks your language. Its human-facing text — errors, the `doctor` and "
"`status` readouts, the `--help` screens — is translated into **all 28 NATO-"
"member languages plus Ukrainian**."
msgstr ""
"goat schwätzt deng Sprooch. Säi mënscheguer Text — Feeler, d'`doctor`- an "
"`status`-Uweisungen, d'`--help`-Schiirmer — ass an **all 28 NATO-"
"Memberssproochen plus Ukrainesch** iwwersat."

#: src/languages.md:5
msgid "Choosing a language"
msgstr "Eng Sprooch auswielen"

#: src/languages.md:7
msgid "goat picks a language in this order:"
msgstr "goat wielt eng Sprooch an dëser Reiefolleg:"

#: src/languages.md:9
msgid "the `--lang` flag (`goat --lang fr doctor`),"
msgstr "d'`--lang`-Flag (`goat --lang fr doctor`),"

#: src/languages.md:10
msgid "the `GOAT_LANG` environment variable (`export GOAT_LANG=uk`),"
msgstr "d'`GOAT_LANG`-Ëmgéigendsvariabel (`export GOAT_LANG=uk`),"

#: src/languages.md:11
msgid "your operating system's locale,"
msgstr "d'Locale vun dengem Betribssystem,"

#: src/languages.md:12
msgid "English."
msgstr "Englesch."

#: src/languages.md:15
msgid "# just this command, in German\n"
msgstr "# nëmmen dëse Befehl, op Däitsch\n"

#: src/languages.md:16
msgid "# everything, in French, for this shell\n"
msgstr "# alles, op Franséisch, fir dës Shell\n"

#: src/languages.md:19
msgid ""
"English is the authoritative source: if a phrase hasn't been translated yet, "
"goat shows the English rather than a blank."
msgstr ""
"Englesch ass déi maassgeblech Quell: wann eng Phrase nach net iwwersat ass, "
"weist goat d'Englescht éischter wéi e Läert."

#: src/languages.md:21
msgid "What stays the same in every language"
msgstr "Wat an all Sprooch d'selwecht bleift"

#: src/languages.md:23
msgid ""
"The **machine surface never changes**. `--json` field values, error codes "
"(`E_OFF_MESH`, …), exit codes, command and flag names, and contract tokens "
"(paths, keys, URLs) are byte-for-byte identical no matter the language. "
"Translate the prose, not the contract — so your scripts work the same for "
"every operator."
msgstr ""
"D'**Maschinnesurface ännert sech ni**. `--json`-Feldwäerter, Feelercoden "
"(`E_OFF_MESH`, …), Exit-Coden, Befehls- a Flag-Nimm, a Kontrakt-Tokens "
"(Pied, Schlësselen, URLen) sinn Byte-fir-Byte identesch egal wéi eng "
"Sprooch. Iwwersetz d'Prosa, net de Kontrakt — sou datt deng Scripten "
"d'selwecht fir all Operateur funktionéieren."

#: src/languages.md:25
msgid "A note on machine-translated text"
msgstr "Eng Notiz zu maschinnen-iwwersatem Text"

#: src/languages.md:27
msgid ""
"Most translations are machine-produced and awaiting native-speaker review. "
"When you run goat in one of those languages, it prints a short, one-time "
"notice on standard error telling you the text is machine-translated, that "
"the English is authoritative, and where to report a translation error. "
"Suppress it with `GOAT_I18N_NO_WARN=1`."
msgstr ""
"Déi meescht Iwwersetzunge si maschinneproduzéiert a waarden op eng "
"Iwwerpréiwung vun engem Mammesproochler. Wann s du goat an enger vun deene "
"Sprooche leefs, weist et eng kuerz, eemoleg Notiz op Standard-Error déi der "
"seet datt den Text maschinnen-iwwersat ass, datt d'Englescht maassgeblech "
"ass, a wou eng Iwwersetzungsfehler ze mellen ass. Ënnerdréck et mat "
"`GOAT_I18N_NO_WARN=1`."

#: src/languages.md:29
msgid ""
"If you speak one of these languages and spot something off, that report is "
"genuinely welcome — it's how the catalogs get better."
msgstr ""
"Wann s du eng vun dëse Sprooche schwätzs an eppes Komeschs entdeckt, dann "
"ass deen Bericht wierklech wëllkomm — sou ginn d'Kataloge besser."

#: src/languages.md:31
msgid "And one for fun"
msgstr "An eng fir de Spaass"

#: src/languages.md:33
msgid ""
"`goat --lang tlh` renders the marquee lines in **Klingon**. It's an opt-in "
"easter egg — never selected automatically — and, like every other locale, it "
"can't touch the machine surface. Qapla'."
msgstr ""
"`goat --lang tlh` weist d'Marquee-Zeilen op **Klingonesch**. Et ass en opt-"
"in Easter Egg — gëtt ni automatesch ausgewielt — a, wéi all aner Locale, ka "
"se d'Maschinnesurface net beréieren. Qapla'."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:3
msgid "When something's wrong, start with one command:"
msgstr "Wann eppes verkéiert ass, fänk mat engem Befehl un:"

