msgid ""
"It runs four steps in order and, for any that fails, prints a specific fix. "
"Here's how to read it."
msgstr ""
"Et leeft véier Schrëtt an der Reiefolleg a, fir jiddwereen deen feelt, weist "
"eng spezifesch Behiewung. Hei ass wéi een et liest."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:11
msgid "Reading `goat doctor`"
msgstr "`goat doctor` liesen"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "Step"
msgstr "Schrëtt"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "What it checks"
msgstr "Wat et iwwerpréift"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "If it fails"
msgstr "Wann et feelt"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "**mesh**"
msgstr "**mesh**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "You're on the fabric's network"
msgstr "Du bass um Netzwierk vun der Fabric"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "You're off-mesh — bring up your tunnel (`netbird status` / re-enroll)"
msgstr ""
"Du bass off-mesh — bréng däin Tunnel op (`netbird status` / nei aschreiwen)"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid "**router**"
msgstr "**router**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid "The fabric's router is reachable"
msgstr "De Router vun der Fabric ass erreechbar"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid ""
"The router may be down, or your endpoint is wrong — re-check your profile"
msgstr ""
"De Router ass vläicht ënnen, oder däin Endpoint ass verkéiert — iwwerpréif "
"däi Profil nach eng Kéier"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "**certificate**"
msgstr "**certificate**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "Your identity is accepted"
msgstr "Deng Identitéit gëtt ugeholl"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid ""
"Your cert may be expired or rejected — `goat profile show`, then re-onboard "
"if needed"
msgstr ""
"Däin Zertifikat ass vläicht ofgelaf oder ofgewisen — `goat profile show`, "
"dann nei onboarden wann néideg"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "**portal**"
msgstr "**portal**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "Your access token works"
msgstr "Däin Access-Token funktionéiert"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "Token expired or revoked — ask to be re-onboarded"
msgstr "Token ofgelaf oder zréckgezunn — frot fir nei onboardéiert ze ginn"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:20
msgid ""
"Each failed step exits with a distinct code, so a wrapper script can branch "
"without parsing text."
msgstr ""
"All feelgeschloene Schrëtt verléisst mat engem ënnerschiddleche Code, sou "
"datt e Wrapper-Script ofzweigen kann ouni Text ze parsen."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:22
msgid "Common situations"
msgstr "Heefeg Situatiounen"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:24
msgid ""
"**\"off the ZTOL — not connected to the mesh\"** You're not on the fabric's "
"network. Bring up your mesh tunnel and try again; `goat doctor` will confirm "
"once you're on."
msgstr ""
"**\"off the ZTOL — not connected to the mesh\"** Du bass net um Netzwierk "
"vun der Fabric. Bréng däi Mesh-Tunnel op a probéier nach eng Kéier; `goat "
"doctor` bestätegt soubal s du dropp bass."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:27
msgid ""
"**\"mTLS cert expired or rejected by the router\"** Your identity is stale. "
"`goat profile show` to see its expiry; if it's past, you'll need a fresh "
"bundle."
msgstr ""
"**\"mTLS cert expired or rejected by the router\"** Deng Identitéit ass "
"verfall. `goat profile show` fir hir Verfallszäit ze gesinn; wann se "
"laanscht ass, brauchs du e frësche Bündel."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:30
msgid ""
"**\"portal rejected the Bearer token\"** Your access token is no longer "
"valid (expired or revoked). Ask your administrator to re-onboard you."
msgstr ""
"**\"portal rejected the Bearer token\"** Däin Access-Token ass net méi "
"gülteg (ofgelaf oder zréckgezunn). Frot däin Administrateur fir dech nei ze "
"onboarden."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:33
msgid ""
"**`goat status` shows a `[✗]`** `status` is the one-glance view; run `goat "
"doctor` for the stepped detail and the specific remedy."
msgstr ""
"**`goat status` weist e `[✗]`** `status` ass d'Een-Bléck-Vue; laf `goat "
"doctor` fir de gestaffelten Detail an déi spezifesch Behiewung."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:36
msgid ""
"**`goat status` shows `ztol` green but `session` red** The router port accepts connections, but a Zenoh session does not open: the router is wedged, or it rejects your certificate. A mesh bounce does not fix this. Run `goat doctor` and tell your administrator."
msgstr ""
"**`goat status` weist `ztol` gréng, awer `session` rout** De Port vum Router hëlt Verbindungen un, mä eng Zenoh-Sessioun geet net op: de Router hänkt oder refuséiert däin Zertifikat. En Neistart vun der Mesh-Verbindung behieft dat net. Start `goat doctor` a sot ärem Administrateur Bescheed."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:39
msgid "Understanding an error code"
msgstr "E Feelercode verstoen"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:38
msgid "Every error carries a stable code (like `E_OFF_MESH`). To look one up:"
msgstr ""
"All Feeler dréit e stabilen Code (wéi `E_OFF_MESH`). Fir een nozekucken:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:44
msgid "Practice without risk"
msgstr "Üben ouni Risiko"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:46
msgid ""
"If you just want to explore commands without touching anything real, the "
"sandbox is always there:"
msgstr ""
"Wann s du just Befehler erfuerschen wëlls ouni eppes Richteges ze beréieren, "
"ass d'Sandbox ëmmer do:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:53
msgid "Still stuck?"
msgstr "Nach ëmmer fest?"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:55
msgid ""
"Capture the exact command and its output (use `--json` for a clean, complete "
"record) and bring it to your goat administrator."
msgstr ""
"Hal de genaue Befehl a säin Output fest (benotz `--json` fir e propperen, "
"kompletten Record) a bréng en zu dengem goat-Administrateur."

#: src/admin.md:3
msgid ""
"`goat admin` is the operator surface: onboarding and revoking participants, "
"rotating certificates, cutting a misbehaving peer off the mesh, provisioning "
"devices, and LAN-side triage. It sits apart from the everyday commands on "
"purpose."
msgstr ""
"`goat admin` ass d'Operator-Uewerfläch: Deelhueler un- a ofmellen, "
"Zertifikater rotéieren, e schlecht behuelen Peer vum Mesh trennen, Apparater "
"provisionéieren, a LAN-säiteg Diagnostik. Et ass bewosst vun den "
"alldeeglechem Kommandoen getrennt."

#: src/admin.md:5
msgid ""
"**Operator-only.** These commands are for operators who hold admin "
"credentials. If you're a participant publishing and subscribing on the "
"fabric, this chapter isn't your day-to-day — your surface is **[Everyday "
"tasks](everyday.md)** (`goat pub` / `sub` / `top` / `who` / `health`). `goat "
"admin` is **inert for non-admins**: an unauthorized call changes nothing and "
"tells you so."
msgstr ""
"**Nëmme fir Operateuren.** Dës Kommandoen sinn fir Operateuren déi Admin-"
"Credentials hunn. Wann Dir e Participant sidd dee publizéiert an abonnéiert "
"op dem Fabric, ass dëst Kapitel net Ären Alldag — Är Uewerfläch ass "
"**[Alldeegleg Aufgaben](everyday.md)** (`goat pub` / `sub` / `top` / `who` / "
"`health`). `goat admin` ass **inert fir Net-Admins**: e net-autorisséierten "
"Opruff ännert näischt a seet Iech dat."

#: src/admin.md:7
msgid "What \"operator-only\" means in practice"
msgstr "Wat \"nëmme fir Operateuren\" a der Praxis bedeit"

#: src/admin.md:9
msgid ""
"The authority isn't in the CLI — it's in _your credentials_. `goat` itself "
"is a thin client; whether you may onboard an org or eject a peer is decided "
"by what your operator profile and environment carry, and confirmed by the "
"portal and the NetBird management API. So an admin command can stop in two "
"honest places:"
msgstr ""
"D'Autorisatioun läit net am CLI — se läit an _Äre Credentials_. `goat` "
"selwer ass en dënne Client; ob Dir eng Organisatioun un- oder e Peer "
"erauswerfe kënnt, gëtt vum Inhalt vun Ärem Operator-Profil an Ärer Ëmgebung "
"entscheet, a vum Portal an der NetBird Management API confirméiert. En Admin-"
"Kommando kann also un zwou korrekten Stellen stoppen:"

#: src/admin.md:11
msgid ""
"**Up front, before anything is sent.** If your machine has no operator setup "
"at all — no initialized profile and no operator environment — `goat admin` "
"refuses immediately with `E_NOT_ADMIN`. Nothing leaves your laptop."
msgstr ""
"**Am Viraus, ier eppes geschéckt gëtt.** Wann Är Maschinn keng Operator-"
"Konfiguratioun huet — kee initialiséierte Profil a keng Operator-Ëmgebung — "
"refuséiert `goat admin` direkt mat `E_NOT_ADMIN`. Näischt verléisst Äre "
"Laptop."

#: src/admin.md:12
msgid ""
"**Server-side, at the action.** If you do have credentials but they aren't "
"authorized for this action, the portal or NetBird returns a refusal. A "
"refused _mutation_ means nothing changed — and `goat` reports it as "
"`E_NOT_ADMIN`, not as a vague token error."
msgstr ""
"**Server-säiteg, bei der Aktioun.** Wann Dir Credentials hutt mee se net fir "
"dës Aktioun autorisséiert sinn, schéckt de Portal oder NetBird eng "
"Verweigerung zréck. Eng verwegert _Mutatioun_ bedeit datt näischt geännert "
"gouf — a `goat` mellt dat als `E_NOT_ADMIN`, net als vagen Token-Fehler."

#: src/admin.md:14
msgid "Two error codes you'll want to tell apart:"
msgstr "Zwee Fehlercoden déi Dir auserneehal wëllt:"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "Code"
msgstr "Code"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Bedeitung"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "What to do"
msgstr "Wat ze dinn"

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid "`E_NOT_ADMIN`"
msgstr "`E_NOT_ADMIN`"

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid ""
"Your credential is **valid but not authorized** for this action (or no "
"operator credential is configured)."
msgstr ""
"Är Credential ass **gëlteg mee net autorisséiert** fir dës Aktioun (oder et "
"ass keng Operator-Credential konfiguréiert)."

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid ""
"Confirm you're on your operator profile and have sourced your operator "
"environment. If you still can't, this action isn't for your role — contact "
"your goat administrator. Re-onboarding won't change it."
msgstr ""
"Confirméiert datt Dir op Ärem Operator-Profil sidd a Är Operator-Ëmgebung "
"gelooden hutt. Wann et nach ëmmer net klappt, ass dës Aktioun net fir Är "
"Roll — kontaktéiert Äre goat-Administrateur. En Neit-Onboarding ännert "
"näischt drun."

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "`E_TOKEN_INVALID`"
msgstr "`E_TOKEN_INVALID`"

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "Your credential is **expired or bad** (HTTP 401)."
msgstr "Är Credential ass **ofgelaf oder ongëlteg** (HTTP 401)."

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "Re-onboard to get a fresh token."
msgstr "Maacht e Neit-Onboarding fir e frëschen Token ze kréien."

#: src/admin.md:21
msgid ""
"Reading about admin is never gated: `goat admin --help` and `goat admin "
"<cmd> --help` always work, in every language. Only _running_ an action is "
"checked."
msgstr ""
"Admin-Dokumentatioun ze liesen ass ëmmer oppen: `goat admin --help` a `goat "
"admin <cmd> --help` funktionéieren ëmmer, a jeder Sprooch. Nëmmen "
"d'_Ausféieren_ vun enger Aktioun gëtt iwwerpréift."

#: src/admin.md:23
msgid "The commands"
msgstr "D'Kommandoen"

#: src/admin.md:25
msgid ""
"Add `--help` to any of these for the full flag set, or see the **[Command "
"reference](reference.md)** — the details there are generated from the "
"binary, so they always match what you're running."
msgstr ""
"Füügt `--help` un een vun dësen derbäi fir den vollen Flag-Satz, oder kuckt "
"d'**[Kommando-Referenz](reference.md)** — d'Detailer do ginn aus dem Binär "
"generéiert, also passen se ëmmer zu dat wat Dir lafen hutt."

#: src/admin.md:41
msgid "A few notes:"
msgstr "E puer Remarken:"

#: src/admin.md:43
msgid ""
"**`lan` is the break-glass diagnostic.** `scan` and `doctor` mutate nothing, "
"need no credentials, and are built to work when the mesh and every service "
"are down — so they're the one part of `goat admin` that isn't refused for a "
"missing operator environment."
msgstr ""
"**`lan` ass d'Break-Glass-Diagnostik.** `scan` a `doctor` muteieren näischt, "
"brauchen keng Credentials, a sinn gebaut fir ze schaffen wann de Mesh a all "
"Servicer erof sinn — si sinn dofir den eenzegen Deel vun `goat admin` dee "
"net fir eng fehlend Operator-Ëmgebung refuséiert gëtt."

#: src/admin.md:44
msgid ""
"**`rotate` keeps identity fixed.** It re-issues the leaf certificate for the "
"same anchor, alias, write namespace, and ACL — only the cert and key are "
"new. Use it for renewal or re-keying, not for changing who someone is."
msgstr ""
"**`rotate` hält d'Identitéit fest.** Et stellt den Blattzertifikat fir "
"déiselwecht Anchor, Alias, Schreif-Namespace a ACL nei aus — nëmmen de Cert "
"a Schlëssel sinn nei. Benotzt et fir Erneierung oder Re-Keying, net fir ze "
"änneren wien jemanden ass."

#: src/admin.md:45
msgid ""
"**`peer cut` is the real cut.** On the brokerless fabric a certificate is "
"inert without a mesh path, so removing the _peer_ is what stops a flooder — "
"`goat health` finds it, `goat admin peer cut` ejects it."
msgstr ""
"**`peer cut` ass de richtege Schnëtt.** Op dem brokerlosen Fabric ass e "
"Zertifikat inert ouni Mesh-Wee, also ass d'Ewechhuele vum _Peer_ dat wat e "
"Flooder stoppt — `goat health` fanns en, `goat admin peer cut` wäerft en "
"eraus."

#: src/admin.md:46
msgid ""
"**Destructive actions confirm first.** `org delete`, `peer cut`, and the `--"
"org` cascades print what they're about to do and ask before acting (`--yes` "
"to skip, `--dry-run` to preview)."
msgstr ""
"**Destruktiv Aktiounen confirméieren éischt.** `org delete`, `peer cut`, an "
"d'`--org`-Cascades drécken aus wat si am Gaang sinn ze dinn a froen ier si "
"handelen (`--yes` fir ze iwwerspringen, `--dry-run` fir Virschau)."

#: src/admin.md:48
msgid "If you see `E_NOT_ADMIN`"
msgstr "Wann Dir `E_NOT_ADMIN` gesitt"

#: src/admin.md:50
msgid "Nothing was changed. Walk through it:"
msgstr "Näischt gouf geännert. Gitt et Schrëtt fir Schrëtt duerch:"

#: src/admin.md:52
msgid ""
"**Are you on your operator profile?** `goat context use <name>` selects it; "
"`goat profile show` confirms which one is active."
msgstr ""
"**Sidd Dir op Ärem Operator-Profil?** `goat context use <name>` wielt et "
"aus; `goat profile show` confirméiert wëlche grad aktiv ass."

#: src/admin.md:53
msgid ""
"**Have you sourced your operator environment?** Admin actions read operator "
"credentials from the environment (for example `GOAT_OPERATOR_HANDLE` and the "
"NetBird admin token) — never from the profile on disk."
msgstr ""
"**Hutt Dir Är Operator-Ëmgebung gelooden?** Admin-Aktiounen liesen Operator-"
"Credentials aus der Ëmgebung (zum Beispill `GOAT_OPERATOR_HANDLE` an den "
"NetBird Admin-Token) — ni vum Profil op der Disk."

#: src/admin.md:54
msgid ""
"**Should you have this access at all?** If you've checked the above and the "
"portal still refuses, your role isn't authorized for this action. Contact "
"your goat administrator — re-onboarding the same identity won't grant it."
msgstr ""
"**Sollt Dir dësen Accès iwwerhaapt hunn?** Wann Dir dat uewen Gesote "
"gepréift hutt a de Portal nach ëmmer refuséiert, ass Är Roll net fir dës "
"Aktioun autorisséiert. Kontaktéiert Äre goat-Administrateur — e Neit-"
"Onboarding mat der selwechter Identitéit gëtt den Accès net."

#: src/admin.md:56
msgid "The full operator workflow"
msgstr "Den vollständege Operator-Workflow"

#: src/admin.md:58
msgid ""
"This chapter orients you to the surface and how it behaves. The end-to-end "
"operator workflow — the capability model, setting up your environment and "
"certificates, and the onboard / revoke / rotate / audit loop — lives in the "
"**admin-operator guide** that ships with your goatnet's operations docs, not "
"in this book."
msgstr ""
"Dëst Kapitel orientéiert Iech un der Uewerfläch a wéi se sech verhält. Den "
"End-to-End Operator-Workflow — d'Capability-Modell, d'Opsetze vun Ärer "
"Ëmgebung a Zertifikater, an de Onboard / Revoke / Rotate / Audit-Loop — läit "
"am **admin-operator guide** dee mat den Operatiounsdokumenter vun Ärem "
"goatnet geliwwert gëtt, net an dësem Buch."

